    "title": "Mid-Level SEO Specialist at Dove India",
    "description": "Dove India is actively seeking a talented and motivated SEO Specialist to join our dynamic team in Chennai. This is an excellent opportunity for professionals who are passionate about making a real impact in a fast-growing organization.\n\nAbout Dove India:\nDove India is a leading organization in the Hybrid sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Execute digital marketing campaigns across Google, Meta, and other channels\n• Collaborate with logistics partners to ensure timely delivery\n• Develop and implement category growth strategies\n• Build and maintain affiliate and influencer marketing programs\n• Create engaging content for product pages and social media\n• Analyze sales data and customer behavior to drive revenue growth\n• Track key performance indicators including GMV, conversion rate, and ROI\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• B.Tech / B.E. in Computer Science or related discipline\n• 6-10 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Google Analytics\n• Proficiency in Affiliate Marketing\n• Proficiency in A/B Testing\n• Proficiency in Supply Chain\n• Proficiency in CRM Software\n• Proficiency in Facebook Ads\n• Proficiency in Shopify\n• Proficiency in Customer Segmentation\n\nWork Mode: Hybrid - Flexible work-from-home and office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Annual paid leaves and casual leaves\n• Professional development and training programs\n• Modern office with recreational facilities\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• Provident Fund and Gratuity as per company policy\n• Meal coupons and food allowance\n• Salary Range: 12 LPA - 25 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Chennai, Tamil Nadu, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Dove India!",
